<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Gold Membership Notification</title>
  <style>
    @font-face {
      font-family: "Proxima Nova regular";
      src: url('../public/font/Proxima-Nova-Regular.otf') format("opentype");
    }
    @font-face {
      font-family: "Proxima Nova thin";
      src: url('../public/font/Proxima-Nova-Thin.otf') format("opentype");
    }

    body {
      font-family: "Proxima Nova regular", sans-serif;
      background-color: #FFF5F7;
      background-image: radial-gradient(#FFC0CB 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 20px 20px;
      color: #5E5E5E;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    .container {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 40px 15px;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    .main {
      background: #fff;
      max-width: 700px;
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 2.5rem;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(233, 30, 99, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid #FFEBEE;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      animation: fadeIn 0.8s ease-in-out;
    }

    .main::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      height: 8px;
      width: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #FF4081, #FF80AB);
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    .logo {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .logo img {
      max-width: 220px;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    h2 {
      color: #D81B60;
      text-align: center;
      margin: 10px 0 20px;
      font-size: 32px;
    }

    .info-box {
      background: #FFF0F5;
      border-left: 5px solid #FF4081;
      padding: 15px 20px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      font-family: "Proxima Nova thin", sans-serif;
    }

    .info-box p {
      margin: 8px 0;
    }

    strong {
      color: #D81B60;
    }

    .footer {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 30px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #888;
      border-top: 1px solid #FFEBEE;
      padding-top: 20px;
    }

    a {
      color: #D81B60;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
      color: #FF4081;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="main">
      <div class="logo">
        <img src="https://admin.vedvivah.com/assets/v.png" alt="Ved Vivah Logo">
      </div>

      <h2>✨ Gold Membership Upgrade</h2>

      <p>Dear Admin,</p>
      <p>
        We’re pleased to inform you that the following <strong>woman user</strong> 
        has been successfully upgraded to <strong>Gold Membership</strong> in the system.
      </p>

      <div class="info-box">
        <p><strong>Name:</strong> <%= name %></p>
        <p><strong>Email:</strong> <%= email %></p>
        <p><strong>User ID:</strong> <%= userId %></p>
        <p><strong>Updated At:</strong> <%= updatedAt %></p>
      </div>

      <p>
        Please review the details at your convenience within the <a href="https://admin.vaidikvivah.com">Admin Panel</a>.
      </p>

      <p style="margin-top: 25px;">
        With <span style="color:#D81B60;">♥</span>,<br />
        The Ved Vivah Admin Team
      </p>

      <div class="footer">
        <p>© 2025 Ved Vivah Admin Portal. All rights reserved.</p>
        <p><a href="mailto:info@vedvivah.com">info@vedvivah.com</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
